# The base's pad pressure: RTRG held, VEL.CUR OFF (a new kit's). Stock writes a roll's pressure to the
# roll's velocity only (0x4011f262: 0x42ac6b4c + 56 x track, the pressure byte times 128) and the RETRIG
# menu RTRG opens drops it, so the sound's aftertouch (0x800067de, BD first) and MIDI poly pressure stay
# still. With the base both follow, and the roll's velocity still follows too.
# Expects BD's VEL.CUR OFF and ALWAYS ON off. Plays a BD roll and leaves its aftertouch at 0.
name: pad-pressure-rtrg-velcur-off
state: changes

hold RTRG
wait 300
midi m begin
pad BD down 100
wait 300
pad BD pressure 60
wait 500
mem at60 0x800067de 2
mem roll60 0x42ac6b4c 2
pad BD pressure 30
wait 500
mem at30 0x800067de 2
mem roll30 0x42ac6b4c 2
pad BD pressure 0
pad BD up
wait 300
release RTRG
wait 300
midi m end
expect at60 == 1e00
expect at30 == 0f00
expect roll60 == 1e00
expect roll30 == 0f00
expect m.polyat > 1
